<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon off list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon off list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers equity strategist David Shulman said Raytheon Co was removed from the firm's large-cap recommended list based on its analyst's downgrading.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 2-5/8 to 46-1/4.</p>
